name: hear - range is checked from where bots stand after moves: A starts 7 cells from B (out of range) but steps 1 west before the shot lands, so B's cell is heard
seed: 1
map: |
  ##########
  #B......A#
  ##########
bots:
  A: script move W
  B: script fire N
beats: 1
expect:
  at beat 1: A.x 7
  at beat 1: A.y 1
  at beat 1: A.heard_set 1
  at beat 1: A.heard_x 1
  at beat 1: A.heard_y 1
